              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani AABBO Waaqi waan Musani jed'e, Amma waan anini Farao tolchu ingarta; inni irrumaani gosa Israeli lafa keesaa baasa, yokhaani irree jabduuni lafa ufii keesaa worra baasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
